  51:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c **** /** @file h_routed_npdu.c  Handles messages at the NPDU level of the BACnet stack,
  52:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * including routing and network control messages. */
  53:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c **** 
  54:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c **** 
  55:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c **** /** Handler to manage the Network Layer Control Messages received in a packet.
  56:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  This handler is called if the NCPI bit 7 indicates that this packet is a
  57:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  network layer message and there is no further DNET to pass it to.
  58:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  The NCPI has already been decoded into the npdu_data structure.
  59:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * @ingroup MISCHNDLR
  60:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *
  61:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * @param src  [in] The routing source information, if any.
  62:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *                   If src->net and src->len are 0, there is no
  63:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *                   routing source information.
  64:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * @param DNET_list [in] List of our reachable downstream BACnet Network numbers.
  65:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * 					 Normally just one valid entry; terminated with a -1 value.
  66:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * @param npdu_data [in] Contains a filled-out structure with information
  67:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  * 					 decoded from the NCPI and other NPDU bytes.
  68:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  @param npdu [in]  Buffer containing the rest of the NPDU, following the
  69:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  				 bytes that have already been decoded.
  70:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  *  @param npdu_len [in] The length of the remaining NPDU message in npdu[].
  71:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_routed_npdu.c ****  */
